MSG_EXAMINE_FAILED
SaferCopy: Examine zlyhalo
MSG_VERIFY_FAILED_DEL
SaferCopy: overenie zlyhalo - subor vymazany
MSG_SETDATE_WARNING
SaferCopy: upozornenie - SetFileDate zlyhalo
MSG_VERIFY_READ_ERR
SaferCopy: overenie - chyba citania
MSG_VERIFY_SIZE_DIFF
SaferCopy: overenie - rozna velkost (%ld vs %ld)
MSG_VERIFY_CONTENT
SaferCopy: overenie - rozny obsah
